Source: bitscan-agent
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Bitdeer-Security <kaiquan.koh@bitdeer.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: bitscan-agent
Architecture: amd64
Depends: adduser, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Bitscan inventory and compliance agent (pre-release)
 Pull-only agent for the Bitscan manager. It enrols with an enrolment
 token, sends a heartbeat, pulls the jobs addressed to its host over TLS
 and uploads the mandatory host inventory: OS details and the full dpkg
 package list. It has no listening port.
 .
 The package holds three static binaries: bitscan-agent, bitscan-runner,
 which runs compliance checks in a sandbox as an unprivileged user, and
 the optional bitscan-capread helper, which is installed disabled. In the
 0.x pre-releases the runner and the helper are idle.
